### =========================================================================
### PRODUCT SHARDING SYSTEM - TESTING API
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1/products


### 1. (Create Product)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PlayStation 5 Pro",
  "brandname": "Sony",
  "quantity": 50,
  "price": 69999.00
}


### 2. (Get Product By ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/a1c3d4e5-f6a7-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d52    
#GET {{baseUrl}}/d4f6a7b8-c9d0-1e2f-3a4b-5c6d7e8f9a67
Accept: application/json


### 3. (Search Products By Name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/name?name=Apple
Accept: application/json


### 4. (Pagination - Page 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/name?name=Apple&page=0&size=3
Accept: application/json


### 5. (Pagination - Page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/name?name=Apple&page=1&size=3
Accept: application/json


### 6.(Search Products By Brand)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/brand?brand=Logitech
Accept: application/json


### 7. (Pagination for Brand - Page 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/brand?brand=Logitech&page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json


### 8. (Edge Case - Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json